# please try to start all libraries with what general purpose they are used for, then the more specific name of where if needed, IE dialogue_intro to say, hey, its dialogue, and its used in the intro!
# if possible also keep libraries of similar types in similar areas for the purpose of making it easier to read. I will soon update the system to work a little better when it comes to parsing files, and to fetch all files within a language folder instead of a specific one so we can have more readability with differnt .loc files.
# note: # or / at the VERY start of a line will make a comment, if you place it anywhere else it currently WONT, this may be future adressed, may not be, lines left uncommented and not structured as a localization will probably implode the system right now.

